   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Lake Victoria Livelihood Program (LVLP) is coordinated by Diakonia and implemented by six faith-based and non governmental organizations in Uganda, Tanzania and Kenya. The overall objective of the programme is to contribute to poverty reduction in the Lake Victoria region within the framework of sustainable development. It has been extended (in a phase-out period) 2011.</narrative>
